Docker Commands 

1) Build a docker image 

docker build -t <imagename> <path> 

Ex : docker build -t krishacicd:/v1 .

2) Check the created image 

docker images 

3) Run the container 

docker run -p <containerport:hostport> -it <dockerusername/projectname:v1> 

Ex : docker run -p 8080:8080 -it krishasuman/v1

4) Push image to registry 

docker push krishasuman/v1

5) Before doing the above, ensure you do 

docker login 

6) Delete a image 

docker rmi <imagename>

