K8S Commands 

Create pods :
kubectl apply -f <deployment.yml file path>

Check pods : kubectl get pods 

Create service :
kubectl apply -f <service.yml file path>

Check service : kubectl get svc 

Create ingress :
kubectl apply -f <ingress.yml file path>

